  "whatWouldMoveTheNumberOffZero": [
    "The 17 families that ship no participant instructions: four obligations fail on the absence. PARTICIPANT_INSTRUCTIONS_GAP.json holds the wave.",
    "The 31 FAIL_REPAIR_REQUIRED verdicts: each names its failing obligations. Repair, then a SECOND independent read, which the ledger cannot yet express for a family whose first read is already released.",
